  "vfx": {
    "Piece": {
      "Note": "pieces/black_cat_aura (2026-10-28 signature, no ribbons): three shadow cats (black silhouettes with a thin gold Neon rim, one plane each, leaning 40 degrees out) race along the top of the shaft toward the tip and back under its belly, a lap in 7 s, galloping; three gold claw swipes (three crescent Neon blades each) hang beside the shaft at 1.9, 3.7 and 5.4 studs and every 3.6 s one tears through the air (a 55-degree Hinge pulse, a Fade beat) and fades, its embers left behind. The body (pieces/black_cat) keeps the living tail and the gold rim shell; the tail flicks every 4.2 s."
    },
    "Moving": {
      "Note": "The tail sways on a 5-bone chain (2.4 s travelling wave) and flicks every 4.2 s (a pulse travelling down the bones: it curls up sharply and drops straight); the collar light flickers."
    },
    "Aura": {
      "Note": "Mythic (brief 2.5; the 2026-10-28 signature, no ribbons): black smoke along the shaft (unlit), faceless shadow cats running in place in it and dissolving (the 4x4 Loop flipbook, black with a thin gold rim), gold embers drifting up and sparks, a claw glint at the tip; ClawEmbers1-3 ride the aura piece's three Swipe joints, so a swipe leaves its embers behind; the gold collar light and a forearm light flicker; gold outline. No beam, no orbiter. About 59 particles a second (budget 120).",
